    "detailed_description": "Bunny Count is a fun and exciting first-person stuffed animal doll shooter game that is perfect for players of all ages. The game features classic game types such as Capture the Flag, Team Deathmatch, and Kill Confirmed in a cartoony, storybook-type setting. Players can choose to play as either a bunny or a bear, and the game works great for local area networks (LANs) and parties.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClassic game types such as Capture the Flag, Team Deathmatch, and Kill Confirmed<br />\r\nCartoony, storybook-type setting<br />\r\nPlay as either a bunny or a bear<br />\r\nWorks great for LANs and parties<br />\r\nJoin the bunnies and the bears on the Bunnyfield for a fun and exciting time!",
